WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.360
I'm Kurata Sana, first year
middle school student.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.160
Award winning writer Mama
and the squirrel Maro-chan!

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.450
Manager and driver Rei-kun!

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.370
- Mysterious white bat, Babbit!
- Sri-lanka!

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.500
Hayama Akito, once a lone wolf is
now my friend.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.920
Matsui Fuka, the girl I met
in the bathroom!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.800
Matsui, I still have
feelings for you...

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.340
What are you saying?

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:58.470
It's over.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:01.300
Really? Is it really over?

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.270
You're not important to me anymore.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.850
Thanks for today Hayama.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:12.320
Thanks to you I feel better.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.530
Thanks so much.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.370
There's Romance
in the Mountains

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.450
Hello, Aki!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.910
Good morning!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.660
That hurt.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.500
What did you say?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.540
That hurt.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.580
It's really a good morning day!

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.500
That hurt.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.380
What, it's such a beautiful morning
to start the day.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.510
That hurt.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.720
Aki, did you see the news yesterday?
It was really interesting.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:48.180
It's all your fault!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.980
You did this to my brother!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.740
Both brothers... want to kill me?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.620
Cut.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.210
Sana-chan, are you ok?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.130
You're both doing really well.
Very emotional.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.540
Break!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.090
It's bound too tight,
I can't stand it.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.590
Excuse me!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.510
The weather is so nice outside!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.840
Sana-chan.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.310
I'm sorry I said those things.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.480
Sana-chan, I really like you.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.310
About that...

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.270
In a crucial moment of the film...

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.280
if I say something I shouldn't,
are you going to be able to continue?

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:43.110
That's not gonna happen,
it's not a big deal.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.530
It's not a big deal?

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.330
I didn't mean it that way!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.490
I was saying I didn't
take it seriously.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.250
I didn't mean that either!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:54.880
I don't understand because
my mind's too jumbled.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.420
Let's put it aside for a... while...
Until I have enough confidence.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.930
It might even be better
to put it in the pot.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.140
It's also strange putting it
in the refrigerator.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.220
Is Sana-chan still sinking into it?

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:10.060
It's quite a task to make a special
visit into the mountains.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.980
I heard the filming process
is going well.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:13.940
Yeah.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.860
You look like you're
feeling pretty well.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:18.940
Really?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.780
Is it true, do you still
like Sana-chan?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.450
Last year's press conference,
you protected Sana-chan.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.330
If you didn't like her
you wouldn't have done that?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.450
Right, right?
You really do like her!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.620
I really do like her.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.000
I knew it!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.960
But I was her admirer for
a long time...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.760
but it's not the kind of
admiration everyone thinks.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.010
It's like a brother sister
relationship.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.550
Sana-chan and me were brought
together by fate.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:48.640
Is that so...

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.140
What's your opinion of him,
Sana-chan?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.890
How do you say 'Fan' in Japanese?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.060
You're wrong, Naozumi-kun...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.020
I also really like Naozumi-kun's acting!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.900
He also lured me into the
film-acting world.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.240
Will you two be falling into love
with each other?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.910
In other words, I'm never going to
admit I lost!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.410
I put my life into this movie...

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.790
it's just like that!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:15.160
Even though the director is really
demanding, it is a rewarding profession.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.120
Another partners

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.170
It's rehearsing here!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.300
No matter what happens,
I'll protect you.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.550
I'm really happy.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.220
Ok, that's enough for today.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.050
If you could show more realistic
romance, it would be better.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.600
You must perform better tomorrow,
understand?

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.350
Yes.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.810
This is embarrassing.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.230
Kurumi-san!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.440
Kawai-kun!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.650
Good work.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.690
This director's really tough,
luckily I was already prepared for it.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.820
What's this hand doing?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.110
We're playing lovers, do you mind?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.240
- No, not at all.
- Is that so?

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:52.990
- You're okay with tomorrow's love scene, right?
- Yeah, it's not even my first.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.920
I see, maybe I'm just too nervous.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.210
Good work.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.790
Is the director still there?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.800
Yeah, he's talking with the
cameraman.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.590
I see, thanks.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.680
Rei-kun?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.180
Did he say anything?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.020
Um... no not really.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.980
Did something happen, Asako-san?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.070
No, nothing.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.480
Really, nothing.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.990
Sana-chan!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.780
This is awesome! There are monkeys
in the hot springs!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.780
Really?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.740
Really! Let's go together!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:35.370
Kurumi-san, can you practice
the script with me?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.160
I can't get it right.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.790
Ok, no problem.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.080
Asako and Rei-kun are acting
a bit strange.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.670
Rei-kun, Asako has a love
scene tomorrow.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.010
Rei-kun, is it ok?
It doesn't bother you, right?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.510
I'm used to Asako's love scenes.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.720
But...

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.010
Just act like you normally do.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.180
See you. Hurry and rest.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.390
Love... love... love love...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.310
Love scene!!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.360
It's okay. We're just getting
a glimpse of it.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.150
Don't tell anyone!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.030
I knew this was going to happen.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.780
So I borrowed Mama's magic stick remote control ladder.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.240
Go!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.200
Press button.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.330
Asako's and Kawai's
love scene, here I come!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:26.380
Don't do it, Sana-chan! The director said we have to be over 18 years old!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.260
If you don't know about the 18 year
old age limit, ask your teacher.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.970
You're teaching bad stuff, Black Babbit!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.970
What?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.180
Do you mind?

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.520
Oh! Kawai-san is in the lead.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.850
I didn't think Asako-san would've
been the leader!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.690
Maybe that's the trend.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.560
In the lead? What's going on...

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.110
- I wanna see a little.
- Me too!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.780
Sana-chan, time's up!
Hurry, let's go!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.700
It was getting interesting too!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.040
Be careful for one minute,
or suffering for your whole life!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.290
Right!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.000
Sana-chan!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.380
Are you ok?

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.710
It's nothing.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.250
- Be careful.
- Yes, yes!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.130
The director is
waiting for us, let's go.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:13.550
Um, Rei-kun, Asako's doing the love
scene now.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.930
Is it ok? It doesn't bother you?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.760
- As long as she's ok, I'm ok.
- It matters here.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.890
Adult's love... I don't get it.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:26.440
Do you understand child's love?
Don't you want to ask her about it?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.690
It's over, it's over.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.320
Do you get nervous in these
love scenes?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.910
Yeah, but I think Kawai-san is
more nervous than I am.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.410
The director made us do it so many
times because we were both so nervous.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.990
What about Kawai-san?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.580
But he looks like he does better
acting in all the other scenes.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.290
Is that so?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.000
That's right, ma'am!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.090
Like this when he puts his hand on
your shoulder...

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:54.800
He can tell that your measurement
is 70 on the bottom with an 85C bra size.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.760
I know all about it...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.890
Is this all that you mean about
Kawai-san acting too hard?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.560
But... but... but he's totally
different from Rei-kun!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.350
That's right!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.480
Really! What's Rei-kun thinking?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.110
Did Rei-kun say anything today?

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.320
Um... nothing different than
from usual.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.910
He's used to your love scenes.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.240
Used to it?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.080
I guess this is because he
recognizes you as an actress.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.580
But he's a little aloof...

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.460
It's only the lovers' gap!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.880
It's a lot of pain, but you and
Rei-kun get it together.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.260
I don't think we should hide
our going out.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.800
But Rei-kun doesn't agree.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.760
Really? Why is that?

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.560
It's because of you.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.930
He says that he's only Sana-chan's
shadow...

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.600
and he doesn't want to become
a big deal.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.070
I don't understand him.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.900
After we got here, we didn't even
have a chance to talk.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.030
In other words, they can't have a
passionate relationship because of me?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.910
Of course, I agree with you,
it's because of this.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.120
Oh, you still don't wear a bra
yet, right?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.500
Bra?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.870
Bra?!
What's it look like!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:12.090
Girls who don't wear bras are
normal!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.050
Sana-chan, are you really
sensitive to bras?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.010
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.430
If I don't ever wear bras,
does it matter?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.100
You're so cute, I think it's about
time you got one.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:31.520
The size of your breast is really
important, but the shape is also important.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.730
Size is not...

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.240
as important as shape!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.450
Even though it's small,
you still should wear a bra.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.450
I never thought about that!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.660
I suddenly really want to bra.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.790
That's right, do you want to go
shopping tomorrow?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.790
There's enough break time
to go to buy one.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.130
Ok!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.630
Tomorrow both of us have filming in
the afternoon.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.090
If we go before dawn, we'll
definitely have enough time.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.590
Ahh! My bra is missing!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.510
Must be the monkey that stole it.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.140
It is him who stole it!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.260
Today is
Bra Day

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.480
Don't worry, don't worry,
I'll be right back.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.480
If you wanted to buy something I'll go.
What do you want to buy?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.020
A Bra!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.150
Kinoshita-san, please take care of them.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.320
Sure, no problem, bye.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:24.450
I'll show it to you when I get
back! Looking forward to it?

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.040
Have a good time...

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.710
A bra...
Sana-chan, stay a young girl.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.210
Rei-kun, isn't this dangerous?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:37.840
Hi, lady! Help me find
a very supportive bra.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.340
We don't have that kind.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.300
Sana-chan, then we'll have to wait
until you're bigger.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.890
- Bigger?
- No, until you grow up I mean.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.560
- Hey, this one's not bad.
- Ok!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.780
Are you done, Sana-chan?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:00.070
- Yeah. It's just right.
- Just fit!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.280
The girl has matured.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.200
Does it hurt?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.580
Sana-chan, do you want me to drive
a little bit slower?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.160
It's ok, we're not in a rush anyway.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.000
I see.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.620
You can't use a cell phone
in the mountains.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.670
Because of these weird radio waves.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.380
Heh heh, Hayama.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.300
She's still a girl without a bra.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:23.380
I'll never let him talk about me
like that again.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.090
Sana-chan's weird.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.510
- I understand.
- I'm home!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.520
Rei-kun! According to our
agreement, I'll show you.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.480
Where?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.650
What is kixa?

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.190
{Parte B}

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.030
It's axki!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.290
Cut.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.580
Ok, Sana-chan! You've worked hard!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.290
Ok! Good work!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.790
For the 2nd scene we need...

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.210
So how was today?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.840
Why did this happen?

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.850
Someone must've done this on purpose.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:10.100
I'm gonna go talk to the producer!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.560
Why?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.060
What?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.560
Locals?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.900
Are you my fans? Can't be!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.780
Don't pretend anymore.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.610
Don't hold on so tight to
Naozumi-kun!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.570
If you ever get close to him, we're
gonna make your life even worse.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:31.160
Right... so you did this?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.620
Don't think that because he's being
kind, you're getting the wrong vibes.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.960
You silly poses make
you look even worse!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.960
Your innocent look only makes
people angrier.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:46.880
We've always been his fans,
he's our life.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.430
We have nothing against you.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.810
- Are you guys local natives?
- Yes!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.730
We were really happy to find out
that he was going to be here.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.440
We know you're one of those lazy
bums, right?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.190
Lazy bum?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.020
There's a lot of gossip from the
managers and actors.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.940
They say things about you and
Naozumi-kun...

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.160
Well, whoever you want to play
with is your choice.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.280
To make it short,
Naozumi-kun is off limits.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:15.410
- Off limits?
- The rumors are worse than before.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.080
I didn't mean it like that.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.830
Then what's this?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.460
This is?

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.590
We've discovered Zenjiro's new lover...

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.550
and she's Miss X from the group
New Half, age 23.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.220
New Half?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.640
If you don't understand what
New Half is, ask your manager.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.730
What are you looking at?
Look at this! Here!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.020
This is?

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.360
Mayu has decided to act in
a new romance.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.740
Tomomi-chan is participating in acting too.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:53.330
They're both very hard working!
I'll work hard too!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.990
It's not that! It's this!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.540
What the hell is this?!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.000
We wanted to ask you!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:03.670
What's this? Lovers' vows?
A truthful confession of love? Mutual love?

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:04.710
That's enough!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.050
Don't deceive the innocent Naozumi-kun!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.300
Please.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.590
What are you asking?
What's written here is all a big lie!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.430
Maybe a little bit of truth!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:17.020
But he and I are only classmates
and coworkers, that's it.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.850
Then, why did they put it
in the news?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.400
That's right, leave him!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.570
Don't even think of stealing
our dream!

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.780
These are actually people who
believe this book.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.570
What's going on?

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.660
I don't believe it!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:36.740
Naozumi-kun...
these are you fans.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.330
Sana-chan, did they say
something to you?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.750
Ahh, nothing.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.040
Why don't you talk to them
for a while?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.920
Maeda-san doesn't
want me to do this.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.960
We have to go now.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:52.470
I think your parents are worried
that you're here.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.430
Parents? Not really.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.510
We've already given up.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.730
The sun's ready to set,
we should go home now.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.350
Let's go, Sana-chan.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.480
Um, Naozumi-kun.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:09.150
There's nothing between you and
Sana-chan, right?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.860
Sana-chan, can I see it?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:18.370
You don't love her, right?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.370
What are you talking about?
It's all lies.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.210
It's impossible,
don't worry about it.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.290
Right?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.170
This is a lie.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.880
- But...
- But?

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.840
I... I do love Sana-chan.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.600
What are you saying...?

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.260
I don't like to lie...

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.390
but if we make it too big,
Sana-chan's going to have a lot of problems.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:45.350
It's only my feelings, it has
nothing to do with Sana-chan.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.230
I hope you understand.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:53.240
Sorry, but it's my true feelings.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.110
- Sana-chan...
- Naozumi-kun... but...

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:00.330
Hey! Please don't be upset!
It's all a lie!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.830
Cheer up. Unlucky feeling!

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.380
Did you
have a good
dinner time?

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.630
Dinner time!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.260
Are you going to go
into the net of love?

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.970
Hmm, Rei-kun!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:23.180
If he continues to ignore this,
he won't be able to get out of it!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.730
You really don't understand
a man's feelings.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.440
I want Asako to see.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.780
A... sa... ko!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:35.030
Yesterday we called her
Kurumi-san.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.320
- Sagami-san!
- Yes!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.200
Are you going to eat
all that?

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:43.830
Don't waste food! If you're good
child don't imitate this!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.330
Don't worry, I'll lend you
my jacket.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.290
Ok, then I'll borrow it for a bit.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.540
Evening walk?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.710
Umm well, bye!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.630
Rei-kun, come here!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.930
Wait... waaaait!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.930
Rei-kun, Rei-kun look closely!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.520
Hurry and follow them!
Asako wants you to stop them.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:12.190
You really like Asako! If this keeps on going,
then he'll take her from you!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.650
Is that ok with you?!
Rei-kun!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:16.070
Of course it's not ok.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.240
So why?!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.820
I really like Asako...

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.780
and I'm also her fan.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:27.000
When Asako wants to do her job well
I don't want to bother her.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.210
Even thought it does matter...

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.090
but I don't want to affect her
emotions.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.340
Rei-kun.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.800
If you were me what would you think?
If you were in the same situation as Asako.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.090
If it were me? Well... umm...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:44.560
Of course I want to
do the job well.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:46.640
Even if I like someone.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.980
Why did I just see Hayama's face?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.730
Ah, it's nothing!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:57.690
But girls want to make it clear.
If we don't say it, it'll never be obvious.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.700
Even though this may cause more problems.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.320
But if it's true love,
probably...

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.490
It's true love, must...

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.120
I understand, Sana-chan!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.460
What's going on...?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.920
What's wrong, Sana-chan?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.800
Asako-san is between two guys,
we can't miss this exciting drama!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.010
Let's go!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.430
She is so extreme!

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:26.060
I was really nervous during
yesterday's filming.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.770
Yeah...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.480
Frequently people say
I act as if it's a game.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.730
I always turned so cold toward
the people I like.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:37.980
Asako-san, I want to be closer to you.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.610
<i>He must be too much into his
character.</i>

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.240
Sorry!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:46.160
Um... this is my woman.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.410
Personal relationships are very
difficult to deal with.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.580
What's he saying?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.790
Say she's yours, Rei-kun!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.550
If you're a man then you have to
say it boldly!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.510
I have a chance to talk?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.880
Listen to me, Rei-kun!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.050
You have to make this all clear
now!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.800
Sana!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.510
- Kawai-san, good evening.
- Who is this?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.480
Sana-chan's manager Sagami-san!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.400
How many sunglasses do you have?

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.650
You mean you're...

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.570
Yeah...

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:21.450
To put it simply Rei-kun and Asako-san have been going out since high school.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.910
Even though there are a lot of
blanks in the middle.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:24.990
Blanks!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:27.490
So you can't steal his love.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.000
Oh, okay... Sorry I didn't know.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.870
You could've told me earlier.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.290
I'm sorry. It's because we were
trying to hide our relationship.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.550
Um, sorry about it, but can you
keep this a secret?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.470
We're sorry to ask you so
impolitely.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.130
Ok, I understand.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.430
Sorry.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.890
That's a strange laugh.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.270
I feel sorry for him.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.930
That's right...

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.610
If you were a little more persistent,
this wouldn't have happened.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.320
A little bit jealous?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.570
Yeah, just a little.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.240
Sorry.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.740
Geez. Umm...

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.200
Let's go for a walk.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.290
I don't think he sees you anymore,
Sana-chan.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.750
Don't be too upset that I can't
really take care of you.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:20.960
Don't be upset that I'm filming
all these love scenes.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.890
I wonder what Hayama will think.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.930
I'm always in the country side.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.390
I'm always with Naozumi-kun.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.310
I have something to tell you.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:36.190
Is that it? He's so annoying.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:39.020
Hayama shouldn't think like that.

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:52.490
Connect! Connect! Come on, say something!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:55.910
